<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN" data-page-node-id="8BX2aclQL0IAEEf3mQM8W0">
<head data-page-node-id="sJDVGtQZgrjpHzFtfuSpKx">
<meta charset="utf-8" data-page-node-id="yZpel50dIeF0Mhv2d43prD">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" data-page-node-id="lVsTLxC6iwp4pHfNRQBsAy">
<title>元内核 · 禅境示波器（Phase 3）</title>
<style>
  body { margin:0; min-height:100vh; background:#07090d; color:#cfe3d8;
         font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;
         display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; }
  .wrap { width:640px; padding:18px 12px; }
  header { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:baseline; }
  h1 { font-size:15px; font-weight:500; letter-spacing:.24em; color:#7fd7b4; margin:0; }
  .sub { font-size:11px; color:#5f6d7c; }
  .stage { display:flex; gap:16px; margin-top:14px; }
  canvas#scope { border:1px solid #1a2430; border-radius:14px; background:#0a0f15; }
  .side { flex:1; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:8px; }
  .stat { border:1px solid #16202b; border-radius:10px; padding:8px 12px; background:#0c1219; }
  .stat .k { font-size:11px; color:#7c8b99; }
  .stat .v { font-size:20px; color:#9fe1cb; font-weight:500; }
  .stat .v.dim { color:#c9b37e; }
  .mini { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; font-size:11px; color:#5f6d7c; }
  button { margin-top:12px; padding:8px 16px; border:1px solid #1d9e75; border-radius:8px;
           background:#0d231c; color:#9fe1cb; cursor:pointer; font:inherit; }
  button:active { background:#123529; }
  canvas#spark { width:640px; height:46px; margin-top:10px; border:1px solid #16202b;
                 border-radius:10px; background:#0a0f15; }
  #err { display:none; margin-top:10px; padding:8px 12px; border:1px solid #a32d2d;
         border-radius:8px; background:#2a0f0f; color:#f09595; font-size:12px;
         white-space:pre-wrap; word-break:break-all; }
</style>
</head>
<body data-page-node-id="aFQZy4yfbZsCiaPBkKuEpJ">
<div class="wrap" data-page-node-id="9gapHDZXveVwUiqGk0SNnx">
  <header data-page-node-id="h7VCfZTDwSbkEy8nAkZc23">
    <h1 data-page-node-id="E8OVFOSApO5uCwkyMAZ7Wb">META-KERNEL · 禅境示波器</h1>
    <span class="sub" data-page-node-id="ssGo94PmsVyt1ylHlqtw02">同一内核 · WASM 直驱 · 0 锚点呼吸</span>
  </header>
  <div class="stage" data-page-node-id="eH3dfAzH9Uc8mcEHVAr8Cu">
    <canvas id="scope" width="340" height="340" data-page-node-id="lS8Lc2df4hhLiRsYMM27vt"></canvas>
    <div class="side" data-page-node-id="qAd1hF5MYZoHwlGGRJ2DmZ">
      <div class="stat" data-page-node-id="SyglkcVX00Xxxw12rsF6Is"><div class="k" data-page-node-id="dverI2mqXyBXKGmX0X9Qsm">内核输出 pop_result</div><div class="v" id="out" data-page-node-id="kaxLQxe7X3p2x3lPoXqtKb">0.000</div></div>
      <div class="stat" data-page-node-id="oY2FBP1iG9baEbvuPzt2JZ"><div class="k" data-page-node-id="SjYvwlAYRNFqxiffYgTvdC">系统熵 get_entropy</div><div class="v dim" id="ent" data-page-node-id="7Bhdut81KfHVAHGKAkMSHh">1.000</div></div>
      <div class="stat" data-page-node-id="5H77LT608wyaqIFffSrH3Y"><div class="k" data-page-node-id="bAWZFrzSRMvN28OnfY2aiN">思考链长度（推演步数）</div><div class="v" id="chainLen" data-page-node-id="EC7k3hcwkGURoHSDtXKd53">0</div></div>
      <div class="stat" data-page-node-id="FWHr89lAYB0kEEYpoixvrl"><div class="k" data-page-node-id="fL75qCiJ6zqmsCqd5YLYfi">推演节点数（窗口）</div><div class="v" id="chainNodes" data-page-node-id="TeuAIFHIR8K5PYEjEAxhux">0</div></div>
      <div class="stat" data-page-node-id="gRtSmDLDSIVOGfoKeSgf3s"><div class="k" data-page-node-id="s16zWLSbVEgOcLbOHx5I6E">双链诊断</div>
        <div class="mini" data-page-node-id="mLfsh8ospZWyJUsa9adJVk"><span id="diag" data-page-node-id="1Rg4cI1k7PHz71KnFAiAFg">形成 0 步 · 解决 0 步</span><span id="diagState" data-page-node-id="ixlQ6UyBLA0yjz1OAz06tM">未启动</span></div>
      </div>
      <button id="seedBtn" data-page-node-id="wgxtjOJHPIerRL13V66mQj">注入扰动 (1.0)</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <canvas id="spark" width="640" height="46" data-page-node-id="dRHjsnNiwMVuUFmVPe6S6K"></canvas>
  <div id="err" data-page-node-id="FscXfQIEEMd9VO4EFB7X6g"></div>
  <p class="sub" style="text-align:center;margin-top:8px" data-page-node-id="ZCbwNx5FrgskuesBLbeblF">
    波形 = 内核输出时间序列（呼吸痕迹）｜ 部署：GitHub Pages 或
    <code data-page-node-id="6HAY0maEmXV7d5XZojXJKe">python3 examples/tools/serve.py examples/zen-oscilloscope</code>
  </p>
</div>
<script src="zen.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
